WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.752
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.993 --> 00:00:07.660
SPEAKER 1: In this
video, we'll show you

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:11.080
how to get pipeline
notifications from Chatbot.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:14.200
Go to the Vertex
Pipelines Codelab,

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.620
and copy the codes one by one.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.400
Run each of them in
Cloud Shell and Notebook.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.280
Open Chat.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.260
Create a chatroom and webhook.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.850
Copy the webhook URL.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.380
Go back to the notebook.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:45.160
Specify that URL to which
the pipeline component

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.970
will send an HTTP request.

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:52.270
Specify the
notification message.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:55.300
Run the pipeline and click
the pipeline job link.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.470
[NOTIFICATION CHIME]

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:01.070
That's it.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:03.710
To learn more about
Vertex Pipelines,

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:06.169
check out the links in
the video description.

00:01:06.169 --> 00:01:09.819
[MUSIC PLAYING]

